# Negative Subject markers for the near past and distant past to be used in the combination [object]+[subject]+[stem]
# I think its called relative pronouns in English
# gwemutaalabye
# Since the apostrophe is a breaking point, words like
# gw'otaalabye, z'ataalya are handled by creating independent words like otaalaba, otaalya which do not exist and may be 
# troublesome when generating suggestions but I think it can be solved using language tool
PFX nP Y 21
PFX nP 0 saa .
PFX nP 0 otoo .
